{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
Concat draws its window and composites video with Vulkan.  Install the
Vulkan driver for your GPU (graphics/mesa-dri for AMD and Intel, or the
NVIDIA driver), or Mesa's software rasteriser (lavapipe) on a machine
without one.

Concat opens and saves files through the XDG desktop portal, which needs
a D-Bus session bus.  If your desktop does not start one, run Concat
under one, for example with

  dbus-run-session concat

Sound goes through ALSA's OSS plugin.  The models for captions, voices
and background removal are downloaded from Settings when they are first
used, into ~/.local/share/app.concat.editor.
EOM
}
]
